  "title": "2 Bed 2 Bath Apartment at Highbury Place in Point Grey Vancouver - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 14 days ago\n\nprint\n$3,500 / 2br - 1046ft2 - 2 Bed 2 Bath Apartment at Highbury Place in Point Grey Vancouver (Vancouver Point Grey)\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n2BR / 2Ba 1046ft2\nrent period: monthly\napartment\nw/d in unit\nattached garage\nno smoking\nWelcome to this spacious 2 Bed 2 Bath home at Highbury Place, conveniently located near Alma Street and West 8th Avenue on Vancouver’s West Side. Over 1,000 sq ft of living space, a functional layout, and bedrooms separated for added privacy, this home is a great fit for professionals, couples, or small families looking for space and convenience.\n\nHome Highlights\n\n✔ 2 Bedrooms + 2 Bathrooms\n✔ Approx. 1,046 sq ft of living space\n✔ Functional and spacious layout\n✔ Separated bedrooms for added privacy\n✔ Cozy fireplace in the living room\n✔ Good-sized private balcony\n✔ In-suite laundry\n✔ 1 parking stall included\n✔ 1 storage locker included\n✔ Unfurnished\n✔ Move-in ready\n\nEnjoy easy access to neighbourhood shops, restaurants, parks, and transit, with UBC just a short commute away:\n\nLocal cafés, restaurants and shops along West Broadway and Alma Street within walking distance\nAlmond Park and McBride Park ~4 min walk\nJericho Beach ~10 min drive\nWest Point Grey Community Centre ~5 min drive\nUniversity of British Columbia (UBC) ~10 min drive\nPacific Spirit Regional Park ~10 min drive\nKitsilano shops and restaurants ~10 min drive\nDowntown Vancouver ~15-20 min drive\n\nSchool Catchment\n\nBayview Community Elementary\nKitsilano Secondary\n\nRental Details\n\n* Available November 1\n* Minimum one-year lease\n* Credit check required\n* Reference check required\n* Tenant insurance required\n* No pets\n* No smoking\n\nLocation: 203-3720 W 8th Avenue, Vancouver, BC\n\nHow to Inquire\n\nTo arrange a viewing, please include:\n\n* A brief introduction about yourself\n* Your ideal move-in date\n* Whether you will be living alone or with another occupant\n* Whether you have a pet\n* Your availability to view the unit\n\nProfessionally managed by LATitude Realty Inc.\n\npost id: 7984225494\n\n \n\nposted: 14 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: 3 days ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
